# pop'n music 8: one Sugoroku de 8 round, played to the board (PLAN.md section 20).
# From a save at phase 1 with KRAFT on Tokyo (tools/unlock.py popn8 --nvram DIR phase=1, on a
# copy of a first-booted save):
#   hiraku-popn8 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn8-sugoroku.his
# The coin at 4431 draws the requirement NEW MUSIC (0x8052d7b0 = 27): clear a song from "new 8".
# Stage 1, Can't Stop My Love (the music select's first song), is played from its chart:
# 178 notes, lanes 0-8 = buttons 1-9, at frame 6619 + t * 58.5 / 1000. The chart's times are in
# 1/1024 s (1000 units = 0.977 s = 58.5 frames at 59.94 Hz); the song starts at frame 6620
# (0x8021825c counts its frames). Result: 176 GREAT, 2 GOOD, 0 BAD. Stage 2 is left to fail, the
# round ends, and the roulette moves KRAFT: rtc.nv 0xcc-0xcf (position) 0 -> 1.
# Watches: the drawn requirement, the song's frame, and stage 1's results (combo, -, GREAT,
# GOOD, BAD at 0x80218310).
game popn8
watch req u32 0x8052d7b0
watch songf u32 0x8021825c
watch combo u32 0x80218310
watch j1 u32 0x80218314
watch j2 u32 0x80218318
watch good u32 0x8021831c
watch bad u32 0x80218320
at 4431 press "Coin 1" 6
at 4471 press "Coin 1" 6
at 4591 press "P1 Button 5" 4
at 4831 press "P1 Button 5" 4
at 5131 press "P1 Button 5" 4
